OL,6,GFootballer Jonathan Gjoshe, 22, was  W5
OL,7,Gon the 18:25 train from Doncaster to W5
OL,8,GLondon King's Cross on 1 November    W5
OL,9,Glast year.                           W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GJust weeks into his first season at  W5
OL,12,GScunthorpe United, Gjoshe was        W5
OL,13,Gtravelling to his home in London     W5
OL,14,Galongside 150 other passengers.      W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GHe was sitting at a table seat in    W5
OL,17,GCoach J when a figure appeared over  W5
OL,18,Ghis shoulder. The figure, dressed in W5
OL,19,Gblack, was Anthony Williams, who had W5
OL,20,Gboarded the train moments earlier at W5
OL,21,GPeterborough at 19:26.               W5
